{"date":null,"platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/ed/3a/109604_2K86K.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/ed/3a/109604_2K86K.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/ed/3a/109604_2K86K.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/ed/3a/109604_2K86K.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/ed/3a/109604_2K86K.jpg"},"summary":"初夏时分，蝉鸣成片。蜿蜒的溪水旁，柳条垂丝，随风摇动。在小路的尽头，一头水牛信步来至画的中央。牛背上，穿着短裤短褂的牧童悠然自得吹响竹笛，笛声飘至郊外每一个角落，好一幅天然闲适的画卷。水牛没入水中，享受难得的清凉。牧童斜倚树丫，一条腿自在地晃荡着，他先与鸟儿赛着旋律，之后便沉沉进入梦乡。梦中，他恍惚听到牛儿的呼唤，那顽皮的生灵跳跃玩耍，快乐非常，它自顾自朝着山的尽头踱去，全然不理牧童的呼唤。放眼望去，层峦叠嶂，雾霭重重，少年的牛儿所在何方…… ","name":"牧笛","name_cn":"牧笛","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":88,"total_count":159684},{"name":"上海美术电影制片厂","count":83,"total_count":10511},{"name":"短片","count":83,"total_count":101372},{"name":"1963","count":43,"total_count":266},{"name":"水墨","count":39,"total_count":1358},{"name":"原创","count":31,"total_count":612545},{"name":"艺术","count":24,"total_count":1123},{"name":"特伟","count":23,"total_count":81},{"name":"钱家骏","count":22,"total_count":46},{"name":"剧场版","count":20,"total_count":717297},{"name":"童年","count":14,"total_count":92490},{"name":"中国","count":14,"total_count":31057},{"name":"上美","count":11,"total_count":645},{"name":"水墨动画","count":6,"total_count":18},{"name":"国产动画","count":5,"total_count":5611},{"name":"60年代","count":4,"total_count":171},{"name":"1960s","count":3,"total_count":169},{"name":"戴铁郎","count":2,"total_count":33},{"name":"林文肖","count":2,"total_count":38},{"name":"60s","count":2,"total_count":128},{"name":"s","count":2,"total_count":421},{"name":"接近8分","count":1,"total_count":66},{"name":"电影院","count":1,"total_count":248},{"name":"老害最爱","count":1,"total_count":336},{"name":"动画电影","count":1,"total_count":43478},{"name":"动画短片","count":1,"total_count":2067},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":35399},{"name":"AM","count":1,"total_count":284},{"name":"8","count":1,"total_count":1811},{"name":"1960-1969","count":1,"total_count":64}],"infob